# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Mosquitto Password File Template
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This file is NOT used directly. Generate the real passwd file on the Pi:
#
#   docker exec mosquitto mosquitto_passwd -c /mosquitto/config/passwd zigbee2mqtt
#   docker exec mosquitto mosquitto_passwd /mosquitto/config/passwd ac-service
#
# The real passwd file is stored in:
#   ~/smart-home-prod/data/mosquitto/config/passwd
#
# DO NOT commit the real passwd file to git!
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
